ss=\"fill-[#F89021] group-hover:fill-white transition-colors\"></rect></svg></a></div></div></div><div class=\"md:snap-start md:h-[calc(100vh)]\"><div id=\"section2\" class=\"relative mt-16 md:mt-0  flex flex-col md:h-[calc(100vh-86px)] justify-center items-center\"><div class=\"bg-[#0972CE] hidden  absolute left-0 top-0 md:flex items-center h-[calc(100vh-86px)] w-[46%]\" style=\"clip-path:polygon(0 0, 100% 0, 100% 80%, 0 230%)\"></div><div class=\"flex justify-between  relative items-center max-w-[1440px] px-8 md:px-24  h-full mx-auto\"><div class=\"md:w-[60%] hidden  md:flex justify-around relative\"><img alt=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"600\" height=\"600\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"z-10  h-[372px] w-[580px]\" style=\"color:transparent\" src=\"https://microsoft-offers.avispl.com/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Favisplstorage.blob.core.windows.net%2Favispl%2FPhoto.png&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75\"></div><div class=\"md:w-[40%] w-full md:pr-8 flex flex-col justify-end items-end  text-base font-ibm\"><div><p class=\"pb-4\">The concept of the workplace continues to evolve, this time, driven by two forces:</p><span class=\"flex items-center gap-2 border-b border-gray-300 pb-4\"><span><svg width=\"26\" height=\"27\" viewBox=\"0 0 26 27\" class=\"h-4 w-4\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><rect x=\"0.5\" y=\"16.1108\" width=\"5.59296\" height=\"18.5269\" transform=\"rotate(-90 0.5 16.1108)\" class=\"fill-[#0972CE] transition-colors\"></rect><rect width=\"5.59299\" height=\"17.9795\" transform=\"matrix(-0.707111 -0.707102 0.707111 -0.707102 12.7876 26.0742)\" class=\"fill-[#0972CE] transition-colors\"></rect><rect width=\"5.59299\" height=\"18.1753\" transform=\"matrix(-0.707111 0.707102 -0.707111 -0.707102 25.4634 13.3521)\" class=\"fill-[#0972CE] transition-colors\"></rect></svg></span>The demand for increased flexibility, and</span><span class=\"flex mt-4 items-center gap-2 border-b border-gray-300 pb-4\"><span><svg width=\"26\" height=\"27\" viewBox=\"0 0 26 27\" class=\"h-4 w-4\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><rect x=\"0.5\" y=\"16.1108\" width=\"5.59296\" height=\"18.5269\" transform=\"rotate(-90 0.5 16.1108)\" class=\"fill-[#0972CE] transition-colors\"></rect><rect width=\"5.59299\" height=\"17.9795\" transform=\"matrix(-0.707111 -0.707102 0.707111 -0.707102 12.7876 26.0742)\" class=\"fill-[#0972CE] transition-colors\"></rect><rect width=\"5.59299\" height=\"18.1753\" transform=\"matrix(-0.707111 0.707102 -0.707111 -0.707102 25.4634 13.3521)\" class=\"fill-[#0972CE] transition-colors\"></rect></svg></span>The rise of AI.</span><p class=\"mt-4\">These two forces are reshaping where and how work is done. This evolution of work is even more significant this time around, with everything else happening around people, places, and organizations.</p></div><button class=\"ml-24 relative  transition-transform duration-900 translate-x-0 translate-y-0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"173\" height=\"173\" viewBox=\"0 0 173 173\" fill=\"none\" class=\"animate-[moveFromTopRight_1s_ease-out] h-20 w-20 md:h-40 md:w-40\"><rect x=\"119.055\" y=\"33.9245\" width=\"26.9339\" height=\"89.2186\" transform=\"rotate(45 119.055 33.9245)\" fill=\"#F89021\"></rect><rect x=\"43.293\" y=\"41.8376\" width=\"26.9339\" height=\"86.5832\" fill=\"#F89021\"></rect><rect x=\"43.4492\" y=\"128.333\" width=\"26.9339\" height=\"87.5258\" transform=\"rotate(-90 43.4492 128.333)\" fill=\"#F89021\"></rect></svg></button></div></div></div></div><div class=\"md:snap-start h-full md:h-[calc(100vh)]\"><div class=\"md:py-32 py-16 md:h-[calc(100vh)] h-full   w-full max-w-[1440px]  mx-auto px-8  md:px-32\"><div class=\"flex md:flex-row flex-col h-full justify-between md:gap-50 gap-10 items-center \"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2  w-full md:w-1/2\"><h2 class=\"md:w-[365px] font-salmond-bold text-2xl md:text-[40px] font-bold text-[#0A1D5F] uppercase\">People feel they are unable to keep up</h2><p class=\"text-base font-ibm  text-[#0A1D5F] whitespace-pre-line\">Today, the volume of work is accelerating faster than employees' ability to keep up.\n\nEmail overload persists and after-hours meetings are still holding steady. According to Microsoft, users spend 60% of their time on emails, chats, and meetings, which means the workday still skews toward communication. At the same time, leaders are saying that the shift to hybrid work has made it challenging to have confidence that employees are being productive.\n\nThis means, at all times, we are all expected to do even more than before, in less time and using less resources.</p></div><div class=\"flex flex-col md:h-[500px] h-full w-full md:w-1/2 justify-center items-center relative\"><div class=\" md:absolute w-full md:bg-transparent bg-[#CEE8FF] p-6 md:p-0 md:bg-none  transition-opacity duration-900 opacity-100\"><h2 class=\"text-[#0A1D5F] text-[20px] font-ibm-bold font-bold mb-5\">Do you feel people in your organizations are experiencing burnout?</h2><div class=\"flex gap-[1px]  mt-5 w-full cursor-pointer\"><button class=\"w-[20%] py-2  flex items-center justify-center text-sm cursor-pointer  font-salmond-bold uppercase text-white md:text-lg  font-bold px-4  \" style=\"background-color:#0972CE\">Yes</button><button class=\"w-[80%] py-[18px] cursor-pointer text-white  font-ibm px-4  text-base text-left font-normal\" style=\"background-color:#0972CE\">I am observing increased cases of job dissatisfaction, anxiety, and depression</button></div><div class=\"flex gap-[1px]  mt-5 w-full cursor-pointer\"><button class=\"w-[20%] py-2  flex items-center justify-center text-sm cursor-pointer  font-salmond-bold uppercase text-white md:text-lg  font-bold px-4  \" style=\"background-color:#792481\">No</button><button class=\"w-[80%] py-[18px] cursor-pointer text-white  font-ibm px-4  text-base text-left font-normal\" style=\"background-color:#792481\">I feel employees feel motivated to come to work and have a healthy work-life balance</button></div></div><div class=\"absolute w-full transition-opacity duration-900 opacity-0 invisible\"></div><div class=\"absolute w-full transition-opacity duration-900 opacity-0 invisible\"></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"md:snap-start h-full md:h-[calc(100vh)]\"><div class=\"md:py-32 py-16 md:h-[calc(100vh)] h-full   w-full max-w-[1440px]  mx-auto px-8  md:px-32\"><div class=\"flex md:flex-row flex-col h-full justify-between md:gap-50 gap-10 items-center \"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2  w-full md:w-1/2\"><h2 class=\"md:w-[365px] font-salmond-bold text-2xl md:text-[40px] font-bold text-[#0A1D5F] uppercase\">Hybrid has become mainstream</h2><p class=\"text-base font-ibm  text-[#0A1D5F] whitespace-pre-line\">It's largely become clear. Employers and employees both want the best of both worlds i.e. in-person and remote. Over 70 percent of workers want flexible remote work options to continue, while over 65 percent are craving more in-person time with their teams.\n&nbsp;\nThe question is no longer even 'why and how to do hybrid work', but is now 'how to maximize its value'.</p></div><div class=\"flex flex-col md:h-[500px] h-full w-full md:w-1/2 justify-center items-center relative\"><div class=\" md:absolute w-full md:bg-transparent bg-[#CEE8FF] p-6 md:p-0 md:bg-none  transition-opacity duration-900 opacity-100\"><h2 class=\"text-[#0A1D5F] text-[20px] font-ibm-bold font-bold mb-5\">What is true about hybrid work for your organization?</h2><div class=\"flex gap-[1px]  mt-5 w-full cursor-pointer\"><button class=\"w-[20%] py-2  flex items-center justify-center text-sm cursor-pointer  font-salmond-bold uppercase text-white md:text-lg  font-bold px-4  \" style=\"background-color:#0972CE\">01</button><button class=\"w-[80%] py-[18px] cursor-pointer text-white  font-ibm px-4  text-base text-left font-normal\" style=\"background-color:#0972CE\">We have a 5-day work from office policy.</button></div><div class=\"flex gap-[1px]  mt-5 w-full cursor-pointer\"><button class=\"w-[20%] py-2  flex items-center justify-center text-sm cursor-pointer  font-salmond-bold uppercase text-white md:text-lg  font-bold px-4  \" style=\"background-color:#792481\">02</button><button class=\"w-[80%] py-[18px] cursor-pointer text-white  font-ibm px-4  text-base text-left font-normal\" style=\"background-color:#792481\">Our employees are all remote and distributed across geographies</button></div><div class=\"flex gap-[1px]  mt-5 w-full cursor-pointer\"><button class=\"w-[20%] py-2  flex items-center justify-center text-sm cursor-pointer  font-salmond-bold uppercase text-white md:text-lg  font-bold px-4  \" style=\"background-color:#0A1D5F\">03</button><button class=\"w-[80%] py-[18px] cursor-pointer text-white  font-ibm px-4  text-base text-left font-normal\" style=\"background-color:#0A1D5F\">We have some days each week compulsory for people to come to the office</button></div></div><div class=\"absolute w-full transition-opacity duration-900 opacity-0 invisible\"></div><div class=\"absolute w-full transition-opacity duration-900 opacity-0 invisible\"></div><div class=\"absolute w-full transition-opacity duration-900 opacity-0 invisible\"></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"md:snap-start h-full md:h-[calc(100vh)]\"><div class=\"md:py-32 py-16 md:h-[calc(100vh)] h-full   w-full max-w-[1440px]  mx-auto px-8  md:px-32\"><div class=\"flex md:flex-row flex-col h-full justify-between md:gap-50 gap-10 items-center \"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2  w-full md:w-1/2\"><h2 class=\"md:w-[365px] font-salmond-bold text-2xl md:text-[40px] font-bold text-[#0A1D5F] uppercase\">The return to the office has been a struggle</h2><p class=\"text-base font-ibm  text-[#0A1D5F] whitespace-pre-line\">While employers say getting people back to the office in person is a concern, the fact is people now expect flexibility and autonomy around how, when, and where they work.\n&nbsp;\nPolicy alone cannot reverse this reality. Research shows that people come in 